Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 01:03:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 11/14] A17 (flagged): opt-in arch.pos_enc_none_consume_rng so
 a no-PE build draws the same kernels as the learned-PE build at the same
 seed; F arms use it (check: PAIRED at seeds 1,2)

---
 bnhgq2/qat.py                                    |  5 +++++
 .../chang0926/configs/chang0926-f-n64-s1.json    |  1 +
 .../chang0926/configs/chang0926-f-n64-s2.json    |  1 +
 .../chang0926/configs/chang0926-f-n64-s3.json    |  1 +
